# Boost on 43's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# Candice, trdata.json #319: SNOVER 38, SNEASEL 38, MEDICHAM 40, ABOMASNOW 42 (Avalanche on three of them); the gym's
# Ace Trainers (#268-271, #827-828) are SNOVER/SNEASEL/water lines lv35-39. Torterra (grass/ground) takes 4x from ice:
# Stone Edge (TM71) in slot 0 is 2x on Snover, Sneasel and Abomasnow; Earthquake stays in slot 1 for Medicham. Level 75.
party-level 0 75
party-move 0 0 MOVE_STONE_EDGE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
